  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Smelting : The process of extracting a metal in the state of fusion is called smelting. In this process the ore is mixed with carbon, obtained after the above reactions and heated in suitable furnace.</p><p>SnO<sub>2</sub> and Fe<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub> are reduced by C reduction method.<br />Al<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub> and MgCO<sub>3</sub>. CaCO<sub>3</sub> are reduced by electrolytic reduction.</p>",
    "image": null
